<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <title>Claude Code Free Roadmap</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0d1117;
            --text-color: #c9d1d9;
            --header-color: #58a6ff;
            --code-bg: #161b22;
            --code-border: #30363d;
            --hr-color: #30363d;
            --accent-color: #2f81f7;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hr-color);
            padding-bottom: 0.3em;
            font-size: 2em;
        }

        h3 {
            margin-top: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.25;
            color: var(--header-color);
        }

        p { margin-bottom: 16px; }

        code {
            background-color: rgba(110, 118, 129, 0.4);
            padding: 0.2em 0.4em;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, SF Mono, Menlo, Consolas, Liberation Mono, monospace;
            font-size: 85%;
        }

        .code-block {
            background-color: var(--code-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--code-border);
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            overflow: auto;
        }

        .code-block code {
            background-color: transparent;
            padding: 0;
            font-size: 90%;
            color: #d2a8ff; /* Light purple for commands */
        }

        ul {
            padding-left: 2em;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        li { margin-bottom: 4px; }

        hr {
            height: 0.25em;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 24px 0;
            background-color: var(--hr-color);
            border: 0;
        }

        a {
            color: var(--accent-color);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

        strong { font-weight: 600; }

        .important-note {
            border-left: 4px solid #d29922;
            padding-left: 16px;
            color: #d29922;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Claude Code for Free</h1>

    <h3>Step 1: Install UV</h3>
    <p>Install the <code>uv</code> package manager to handle the project environment.</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Mac</strong>: 
            <div class="code-block"><code>curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh</code></div>
        </li>
        <li><strong>Windows</strong>: 
            <div class="code-block"><code>powershell -ExecutionPolicy ByPass -c "irm https://astral.sh/uv/install.ps1 | iex"</code></div>
        </li>
    </ul>

    <hr>

    <h3>Step 2: Install Python through UV</h3>
    <p>Ensure you are running the latest Python version via <code>uv</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>Command</strong>:</p>
    <div class="code-block"><code>uv python install 3.14</code></div>

    <hr>

    <h3>Step 3: Now we clone Nvidia nim</h3>
    <p>Clone the bridge repository to your local machine.</p>
    <p><strong>Command</strong>:</p>
    <div class="code-block"><code>git clone https://github.com/Alishahryar1/free-claude-code.git nvidia-nim</code></div>

    <hr>

    <h3>Step 4: Now open this folder in your code editor</h3>
    <p>I will be using VS Code to manage the project files.</p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Step 5: Now duplicate the .env example and name it .env</h3>
    <p>Create your local environment file to store your API keys.</p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Step 6: Now go to nvidia nim website and register there</h3>
    <p>Create an account on the official NVIDIA NIM platform.</p>
    <p><strong>Link</strong>: <a href="https://build.nvidia.com/models?filters=nimType%3Anim_type_preview&orderBy=weightPopular%3ADESC" target="_blank">NVIDIA NIM Models</a></p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Step 7: Now choose a free model and grab the model name and paste it in .env file</h3>
    <p>Select a model from the list and update your configuration.</p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Step 8: Now grab the api key</h3>
    <p>Generate your unique NVIDIA NIM API Key and paste it into your <code>.env</code> file.</p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Step 9: now run the nvidia nim</h3>
    <p>Start the bridge server.</p>
    <p class="important-note">Important: Once it starts running, do not stop it or close it, otherwise you won’t be able to use the AI.</p>
    <p><strong>Command</strong>:</p>
    <div class="code-block"><code>uv run uvicorn server:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8082</code></div>

    <hr>

    <h3>Step 10: Install Claude Code</h3>
    <p>From this point forward, you must work in <strong>another terminal window</strong>.</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Windows Command</strong>: 
            <div class="code-block"><code>irm https://claude.ai/install.ps1 | iex</code></div>
        </li>
        <li><strong>Official Resource</strong>: <a href="https://claude.com/product/claude-code" target="_blank">Claude Code Product Page</a></li>
    </ul>

    <hr>

    <h3>Step 11: Run Claude Code</h3>
    <p>Launch Claude Code using these redirect commands to connect to your local bridge.</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Mac</strong>: 
            <div class="code-block"><code>ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN="freecc" ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL="http://localhost:8082" claude</code></div>
        </li>
        <li><strong>Windows</strong>: 
            <div class="code-block"><code>$env:ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN="freecc"; $env:ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL="http://localhost:8082"; claude</code></div>
        </li>
    </ul>

</body>
</html>
